{#
    Monthly spend: six months behind, this month, six ahead.

    The bars behind come from the payment ledger, and are **reconstructed**
    from start dates, cycles and price history for the months before a
    subscription's first recorded payment. The card says so, with the number of
    subscriptions left out for having no start date. This month is one bar in
    two parts: already charged beneath, still due above. The bars ahead are
    the forecast, hatched, and are the Forecast page's own months.

    Drawn on the server: every height is a percentage worked out on minor units,
    and the table beneath holds the same figures for a screen reader and for a
    reader who wants the numbers. When a currency has no rate there is no chart
    at all — a missing month drawn as a short bar would read as a cheap one.
#}
<section class="card spend-bars-card" aria-labelledby="spend-chart-heading">
    <header class="card-header">
        <div>
            <h2 id="spend-chart-heading">{{ t('dashboard.monthly_spend') }}</h2>
            <p class="muted">{{ t('dashboard.spend_chart_note') }}</p>
        </div>
        {% if chart.is_drawable %}
            <ul class="chart-legend" aria-hidden="true">
                <li><span class="chart-key chart-key-actual"></span>{{ t('dashboard.series_actual') }}</li>
                <li><span class="chart-key chart-key-forecast"></span>{{ t('dashboard.series_forecast') }}</li>
                {% if chart.budget_minor is not null %}
                    <li><span class="chart-key chart-key-budget"></span>{{ t('dashboard.series_budget', {'budget': chart.budget_display}) }}</li>
                {% endif %}
            </ul>
        {% endif %}
        {#
            The hatched months are the Forecast page's own, so the card is the
            way in to it from the dashboard.
        #}
        <a class="button button-quiet" href="/forecast">
            {{ t('dashboard.see_forecast') }}{{ icon('arrow-right') }}
        </a>
    </header>

    {% include 'partials/month_bars.twig' with {
        chart: chart,
        caption: t('dashboard.spend_bars_alt', {'currency': chart.currency}),
    } only %}
</section>
